New Core (Packages/RunnerControlCore/Sources): `RunnerRegistration.swift`,
`RunnerRegistration+Models.swift`, `RunnerRegistration+Gates.swift`,
`RunnerRegistration+State.swift`, `RunnerRegistration+State+Reducer.swift`,
